    <Body>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[2]">
            <Text>CoverAmt Cov Perc = CoverPerc Cov CR * ExpAmt ExpEvent when OSGID Cov j = null and New Cover Alloc Ind&lt; &gt; ' Y '</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Perc</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverPerc</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>CR</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>*</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>ExpAmt</mi>
                    <mi>ExpEvent</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>when</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>OSGID</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <mi>null and New Cover Alloc Ind&lt;</mi>
                <msup>
                    <mi>&gt;</mi>
                    <mi>'</mi>
                </msup>
                <msup>
                    <mi>Y</mi>
                    <mi>'</mi>
                </msup>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[4]">
            <Text>CoverAmt Cov Perc = CoverPerc Cov CR * CoverAllocReferenceAmt OSG when OSGID Cov j = null and New Cover Alloc Ind='Y'</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Perc</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverPerc</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>CR</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>*</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CoverAllocReferenceAmt</mi>
                    <mi>OSG</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>when</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>OSGID</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <mi>null and New Cover Alloc Ind='Y'</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[6]">
            <Text>PriceIndexFactor Cov = PriceIndex ReportingDate PriceIndex AppraiselDate if PriceIndex AppraiselDate =0 than 1</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>PriceIndexFactor</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <mfrac>
                    <msub>
                        <mi>PriceIndex</mi>
                        <mi>ReportingDate</mi>
                    </msub>
                    <msub>
                        <mi>PriceIndex</mi>
                        <mi>AppraiselDate</mi>
                    </msub>
                </mfrac>
                <mi>if</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>PriceIndex</mi>
                    <mi>AppraiselDate</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=0 than 1</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[8]">
            <Text>AvailableAmt Cov Indexed = CoverAmt Cov Perc if ( CoverAmt Cov Perc &lt; AbsoluteAmt Cov Indexed/Revalued ) Absolute Cov Indexed/Revalued Otherwise</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>AvailableAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Indexed</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Perc</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>if (</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>CoverAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Perc</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>&lt;</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>AbsoluteAmt</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Indexed/Revalued</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>)</mi>
                <msubsup>
                    <mi>Absolute</mi>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>Indexed/Revalued</mi>
                </msubsup>
                <mi>Otherwise</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[10]">
            <Text>The cover priority for country risk is based on the outstanding group ID and the transfer priority class</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[11]">
            <Text>Starting by the top node of the limit tree all outstanding groups and covers are ordered as follows:</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[12]">
            <Text>By transfer priority class of the cover type - lowest first;</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[13]">
            <Text>By country rating - lowest first;</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[14]">
            <Text>By cover ID - highest first;</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <List ordered="true">
            <Item>
                <Text>By transfer priority class of the cover type - lowest first;</Text>
            </Item>
            <Item>
                <Text>By country rating - lowest first;</Text>
            </Item>
            <Item>
                <Text>By cover ID - highest first;</Text>
            </Item>
        </List>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[16]">
            <Text>CAEventRegCov I = Cov j</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CAEventRegCov</mi>
                    <mi>I</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>Cov</mi>
                    <mi>j</mi>
                </msub>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[17]">
            <Text>order by OSGID Cov j OSGID exists →OSGID not exists     desc</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <mi>order by</mi>
                <msub>
                    <mi>OSGID</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>OSGID exists →OSGID not exists desc</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[18]">
            <Text>TransferPriorityClass Cov j asc</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>TransferPriorityClass</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>asc</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[19]">
            <Text>CountryRating Cov j asc</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CountryRating</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>asc</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[20]">
            <Text>ID Cov j desc</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>ID</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>desc</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <Paragraph source-path="/word/document/p[22]">
            <Text>Where:</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Table>
            <Row>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>CAEventRegCov I =</Text>
                </Cell>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>Represents the list of covers related with the limit Tree</Text>
                </Cell>
            </Row>
            <Row>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>TransferPriorityClass Cov j =</Text>
                </Cell>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>Property of the cover type, looked up in Cover Type table</Text>
                </Cell>
            </Row>
            <Row>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>CountryRating Cov j =</Text>
                </Cell>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>CountryRating GRID if exists otherwise SovereignRating GRID if exists otherwise LocalCCYRating Country if exists otherwise YZ17</Text>
                </Cell>
            </Row>
            <Row>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>ID Cov j =</Text>
                </Cell>
                <Cell>
                    <Text>Cover ID</Text>
                </Cell>
            </Row>
        </Table>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CAEventRegCov</mi>
                    <mi>I</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>TransferPriorityClass</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CountryRating</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>CountryRating</mi>
                    <mi>GRID</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>if exists otherwise</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>SovereignRating</mi>
                    <mi>GRID</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>if exists otherwise</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>LocalCCYRating</mi>
                    <mi>Country</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>if exists otherwise YZ17</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
        <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <mrow>
                <msub>
                    <mi>ID</mi>
                    <mi>Cov j</mi>
                </msub>
                <mi>=</mi>
            </mrow>
        </math>
    </Body>
